# Line endings (docs/MACOS.md): the repository holds LF, so a Mac or Linux checkout gets working scripts and Makefiles
# (macOS's make 3.81 and bash choke on CR). Windows-only scripts keep CRLF in the working tree.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
Makefile    text eol=lf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
